Package: kubuntu-settings-desktop
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: fonts-ubuntu,
         libnewt0.52 (>= 0.52.11-2ubuntu7),
         plasma-workspace (>= 4:5.18.0~),
         software-properties-qt,
         xterm,
         ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: kubuntu-default-settings (<< 1:13.04ubuntu1~),
        kubuntu-driver-manager,
        plasma-nm (<< 0.9.3.1-0ubuntu1)
Replaces: kubuntu-default-settings (<< 1:13.04ubuntu1~),
          kubuntu-driver-manager,
          plasma-nm (<< 0.9.3.1-0ubuntu1)
Conflicts: neon-all,
           neon-desktop,
           neon-settings,
           neon-settings-2,
           ubuntustudio-default-settings,
Description: Settings and artwork for the Kubuntu (Desktop)
 This package contains settings used by Kubuntu. It also
 includes artwork and Kubuntu branding.
 .
 The settings apply to plasma-desktop based workspaces.

Package: plymouth-theme-kubuntu-logo
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label, plymouth-theme-spinner, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: plymouth-theme
Breaks: plymouth (<< 0.9.2-3ubuntu1~)
Description: graphical boot animation and logger - kubuntu-logo theme
 Plymouth is an application that runs very early in the boot process
 (even before the root filesystem is mounted!) that provides a graphical
 boot animation while the boot process happens in the background.
 .
 This package contains the default kubuntu-logo theme.

Package: plymouth-theme-kubuntu-text
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-theme-ubuntu-text, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: plymouth-theme
Replaces: plymouth (<< 0.8.1-1~)
Breaks: plymouth (<< 0.9.2-3ubuntu1~)
Description: graphical boot animation and logger - kubuntu-text theme
 Plymouth is an application that runs very early in the boot process
 (even before the root filesystem is mounted!) that provides a graphical
 boot animation while the boot process happens in the background.
 .
 This package contains the default kubuntu-text theme used when no
 support for a graphical theme is found on your system.
